<title>USA: Remedytemp Inc Q2 March 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Remedytemp Inc Q2 March 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JUAN CAPISTRANO, Calif. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				 Mar 30,   Mar 31,   Mar 30,  Mar 31,</p>
<p>				   1997    1996(a)	1997  1996(a)</p>
<p>				    (Unaudited)	   (Unaudited)</p>
<p> Total Revenue	     $83,587   $65,432  $168,150 $130,113</p>
<p> Cost of Sales		63,702    49,589   128,015   97,849</p>
<p>Licensee Share of</p>
<p>  Gross Profit		 5,289     3,843    10,304    7,554</p>
<p> Selling &amp; Admin Expenses 11,519    10,119    22,799   19,778</p>
<p> Operating Income	    3,077     1,881     7,032    4,932</p>
<p> Other Income, net	     410	 226	 826	408</p>
<p>Income Before Provision</p>
<p>  For Income Taxes	   3,487     2,107     7,858    5,340</p>
<p> Provision For Income Taxes1,447	 843     3,261    2,136</p>
<p> Net Income		    2,040     1,264     4,597    3,204</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share	 0.23	0.16	0.51     0.42</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs		 9,005     7,685     9,014    7,685</p>
<p>		   (Amounts in '000s, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>(a) Results for the comparative prior year period reflect a pro forma tax provision utilizing C corporation tax rates. Prior to July IPO, company was taxed at S corporation rates.</p>
